(1) The Minister of Food and Drug Safety may proceed the procedures for granting approval for handling narcotics pursuant to Article 4 of the Act, permission or designation as a person authorized to handle narcotics pursuant to Article 6 of the Act, license to manufacture, import, or export narcotics pursuant to Article 18 or 21 of the Act, for Tiletamine or Zolazepam classified as psychotropic substances pursuant to the amended provisions of Articles 42 and 43 of Appendix 4 before the enforcement date provided for in the proviso to Article 1 of this Addenda, if deemed necessary for the enforcement of this Decree.
